            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A user equipment in a radio communication system including the user equipment and a base station that transmits a plurality of reference signals, including: an uplink transmission power information calculation unit configured to estimate a pathloss between the base station and the user equipment based on received power of the reference signal for each reference signal of the plurality of reference signals, and to calculate uplink transmission power information; and a signal transmission unit configured to generate control information in which the uplink transmission power information is set for each resentence signal of the plurality of reference signals, and transmit the control information to the base station.</p>
